  "account": "林睿读书&书在橱窗",
  "source_title": "上集盘到第六，今天开第五到第一。都江堰为啥只排第五？第一名没砖没铁，靠一套老规矩干了两千多年#都江堰#中国古代建筑#万里长城#中国智慧#历史冷知识",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 371.4039,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "第五名，四川都江堰战国时候修的，在成都平原西部的岷江上两千二百多年了。修他的人叫李冰，秦国派到四川的太守，这个工程最绝的地方在哪儿？他没有坝全世界。到现在为止，都江堰是年代最久，唯一留存还在一直使用的无坝引水工程。怎么分水岷江中间修了一个鱼嘴，把江江分成两条外江泄洪，内江灌溉枯水的时候，六成水进内江，四成进外江发大水的时候，反过来六成水排走四成流下。更神的是，排沙内江边上有一个飞沙堰，比河床高两米水一大，多余的洪水和沙子，自己就甩出去了两千两百多年了。到今天，还在灌溉一千多万亩农田钱养活两千多万人。您说一座没有坝的水利工程，干了两千多年，活一天没歇过这事上哪儿找去？第四名，新疆坎儿井在吐鲁番跟万里长城、京杭大运河，并称中国古代三大工程。吐鲁番那个地方一年下雨也就十几毫米，蒸发量三千多毫米，地上的水根本存不住。古人想了个什么办法？把天山的雪水从地底下引过来，怎么引先打一溜树井，然后在井底下挖暗渠，把水从地下悄悄送到几十公里外的绿洲，地面上一滴水都看不见，庄稼，却喝得饱饱的。全江现在还有一千五百多条坎儿井，岸渠加起来超过三千四百公里。林则徐当年被发配到新疆，带着老百姓修了六十多条当地人，到现在还管他叫林公瑾，没有电，没有泵，没有管子，全靠人一敲一敲。在地下挖出来的第三名，四川乐山大佛唐朝开元元年开始修的，修了整整九十年才完工，发起的人叫海通禅师凌云寺的和尚。他为什么要修这尊佛？因为岷江、大渡河、青衣江、三江汇流的地方水流太急，船走到那儿经常撞得粉碎，海通募捐了二十年，攒了一笔钱。当地有个地方官跑来要钱。海通说了一句话，肆目可望佛才难得。眼睛可以挖，给你修佛的钱，你一分也别想拿。说完自己把眼睛挖了出来，端着盘子递过去。那个官吓得转身就跑，大佛修了九十年，通高七十一米，耳朵就有七米长脚，背上能坐一百多个人，更绝得是大佛身上藏着一套完整的排水系统。一千多年了，石头没怎么分化，一个人发了愿几代人接着干，把一座山凿成了一尊佛。第二名，万里长城从西周开始修，秦始皇连起来，明朝大规模重建，前前后后修了两千多年，把历代修的长城加起来，总长度超过两万公里。您知道这工程量有多大吗？嘉峪关的城墙如果换算成一米厚，五米高的墙，能把地球绕一圈。明朝修长城用了多少砖？传说当年工匠算出来，嘉峪关关城需要九十九万九千九百九十九块砖，多一块都不要。结果竣工的时候，偏偏多出来一块放在西瓮城的门台上，几百年来没人敢动他，老百姓管他叫定城砖一块砖，放了几百年，谁都不敢碰。您说这规矩严到什么份上？第一名，四川都江堰等等。都江堰不是第五名吗？对，第五名是都江堰水利工程。我说的第一名是都江堰底下的那套地下维护系统。您知道都江堰两千多年不坏，靠的是什么吗？不是靠石头，硬是靠制度。李斌当年定了六个字的规矩，深陶滩低作焰。每年冬天枯水期。河宫要把内江河床挖到看见埋在底下的石马为止。这就是深淘滩飞沙堰的高度必须比内江河床低。这就是低座堰李冰还在河床底下埋了卧铁。作为青淤深度的标准，这套维护制度从秦朝一直执行到今天，两千两百多年没断过别的古建筑，靠的是材料和手艺。都江堰靠的是一代一代人守着规矩干活，这才是真正坐头把交椅的东西。不是死的建筑，是活的制度。从第五道第一名，都江堰用两千两百年的规矩养活了上千万人。坎儿井在地下三千多公里悄悄送水。乐山大佛一个人挖了眼睛，几代人凿了九十年，长城一块定成砖，放了几百年，没人干度。都江堰底下的清淤制度一天没断过，可您知道吗？这五座里面有三座，到今天还在干活，还有两座藏州的秘密，到现在都没解开，点个关注，下一期咱们接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 690,
      "text": "第五名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1050,
      "end_ms": 4530,
      "text": "四川都江堰战国时候修的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4710,
      "end_ms": 8890,
      "text": "在成都平原西部的岷江上两千二百多年了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00004",
      "start_ms": 9250,
      "end_ms": 10550,
      "text": "修他的人叫李冰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00005",
      "start_ms": 11050,
      "end_ms": 12890,
      "text": "秦国派到四川的太守，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00006",
      "start_ms": 13430,
      "end_ms": 15730,
      "text": "这个工程最绝的地方在哪儿？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00007",
      "start_ms": 15810,
      "end_ms": 17830,
      "text": "他没有坝全世界。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00008",
      "start_ms": 17830,
      "end_ms": 18770,
      "text": "到现在为止，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00009",
      "start_ms": 19050,
      "end_ms": 20810,
      "text": "都江堰是年代最久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00010",
      "start_ms": 21250,
      "end_ms": 26010,
      "text": "唯一留存还在一直使用的无坝引水工程。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00011",
      "start_ms": 26650,
      "end_ms": 29310,
      "text": "怎么分水岷江中间修了一个鱼嘴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00012",
      "start_ms": 29310,
      "end_ms": 33280,
      "text": "把江江分成两条外江泄洪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00013",
      "start_ms": 33640,
      "end_ms": 36100,
      "text": "内江灌溉枯水的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00014",
      "start_ms": 36360,
      "end_ms": 38140,
      "text": "六成水进内江，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00015",
      "start_ms": 38240,
      "end_ms": 40620,
      "text": "四成进外江发大水的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00016",
      "start_ms": 40620,
      "end_ms": 43820,
      "text": "反过来六成水排走四成流下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00017",
      "start_ms": 44160,
      "end_ms": 45260,
      "text": "更神的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00018",
      "start_ms": 45280,
      "end_ms": 48300,
      "text": "排沙内江边上有一个飞沙堰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00019",
      "start_ms": 48660,
      "end_ms": 51120,
      "text": "比河床高两米水一大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00020",
      "start_ms": 51540,
      "end_ms": 52920,
      "text": "多余的洪水和沙子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00021",
      "start_ms": 52920,
      "end_ms": 55900,
      "text": "自己就甩出去了两千两百多年了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00022",
      "start_ms": 56020,
      "end_ms": 56800,
      "text": "到今天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00023",
      "start_ms": 57040,
      "end_ms": 62445,
      "text": "还在灌溉一千多万亩农田钱养活两千多万人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00024",
      "start_ms": 62920,
      "end_ms": 65835,
      "text": "您说一座没有坝的水利工程，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00025",
      "start_ms": 66370,
      "end_ms": 67390,
      "text": "干了两千多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00026",
      "start_ms": 67390,
      "end_ms": 70435,
      "text": "活一天没歇过这事上哪儿找去？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00027",
      "start_ms": 71590,
      "end_ms": 72195,
      "text": "第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00028",
      "start_ms": 72660,
      "end_ms": 78105,
      "text": "新疆坎儿井在吐鲁番跟万里长城、京杭大运河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00029",
      "start_ms": 78400,
      "end_ms": 81185,
      "text": "并称中国古代三大工程。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00030",
      "start_ms": 82240,
      "end_ms": 86585,
      "text": "吐鲁番那个地方一年下雨也就十几毫米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00031",
      "start_ms": 87620,
      "end_ms": 89585,
      "text": "蒸发量三千多毫米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00032",
      "start_ms": 90130,
      "end_ms": 92125,
      "text": "地上的水根本存不住。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00033",
      "start_ms": 93120,
      "end_ms": 94425,
      "text": "古人想了个什么办法？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00034",
      "start_ms": 94990,
      "end_ms": 98085,
      "text": "把天山的雪水从地底下引过来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00035",
      "start_ms": 98500,
      "end_ms": 100475,
      "text": "怎么引先打一溜树井，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00036",
      "start_ms": 100850,
      "end_ms": 102665,
      "text": "然后在井底下挖暗渠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00037",
      "start_ms": 103250,
      "end_ms": 107215,
      "text": "把水从地下悄悄送到几十公里外的绿洲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00038",
      "start_ms": 108080,
      "end_ms": 110185,
      "text": "地面上一滴水都看不见，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00039",
      "start_ms": 110680,
      "end_ms": 111200,
      "text": "庄稼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00040",
      "start_ms": 111200,
      "end_ms": 112385,
      "text": "却喝得饱饱的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00041",
      "start_ms": 113310,
      "end_ms": 117190,
      "text": "全江现在还有一千五百多条坎儿井，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00042",
      "start_ms": 117210,
      "end_ms": 120655,
      "text": "岸渠加起来超过三千四百公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00043",
      "start_ms": 121130,
      "end_ms": 123255,
      "text": "林则徐当年被发配到新疆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00044",
      "start_ms": 123660,
      "end_ms": 126710,
      "text": "带着老百姓修了六十多条当地人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00045",
      "start_ms": 126710,
      "end_ms": 128655,
      "text": "到现在还管他叫林公瑾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00046",
      "start_ms": 129300,
      "end_ms": 129860,
      "text": "没有电，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00047",
      "start_ms": 130140,
      "end_ms": 130700,
      "text": "没有泵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00048",
      "start_ms": 130980,
      "end_ms": 131880,
      "text": "没有管子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00049",
      "start_ms": 132120,
      "end_ms": 133660,
      "text": "全靠人一敲一敲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00050",
      "start_ms": 133660,
      "end_ms": 136475,
      "text": "在地下挖出来的第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00051",
      "start_ms": 136810,
      "end_ms": 141405,
      "text": "四川乐山大佛唐朝开元元年开始修的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00052",
      "start_ms": 141810,
      "end_ms": 144175,
      "text": "修了整整九十年才完工，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00053",
      "start_ms": 144790,
      "end_ms": 149225,
      "text": "发起的人叫海通禅师凌云寺的和尚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00054",
      "start_ms": 150170,
      "end_ms": 151835,
      "text": "他为什么要修这尊佛？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00055",
      "start_ms": 152180,
      "end_ms": 158615,
      "text": "因为岷江、大渡河、青衣江、三江汇流的地方水流太急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00056",
      "start_ms": 159100,
      "end_ms": 161465,
      "text": "船走到那儿经常撞得粉碎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00057",
      "start_ms": 162210,
      "end_ms": 163905,
      "text": "海通募捐了二十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00058",
      "start_ms": 164270,
      "end_ms": 165245,
      "text": "攒了一笔钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00059",
      "start_ms": 166010,
      "end_ms": 167955,
      "text": "当地有个地方官跑来要钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00060",
      "start_ms": 168500,
      "end_ms": 169715,
      "text": "海通说了一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00061",
      "start_ms": 170120,
      "end_ms": 172250,
      "text": "肆目可望佛才难得。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00062",
      "start_ms": 172650,
      "end_ms": 173590,
      "text": "眼睛可以挖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00063",
      "start_ms": 173590,
      "end_ms": 175200,
      "text": "给你修佛的钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00064",
      "start_ms": 175200,
      "end_ms": 176445,
      "text": "你一分也别想拿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00065",
      "start_ms": 176860,
      "end_ms": 178735,
      "text": "说完自己把眼睛挖了出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00066",
      "start_ms": 179020,
      "end_ms": 180415,
      "text": "端着盘子递过去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00067",
      "start_ms": 180990,
      "end_ms": 182855,
      "text": "那个官吓得转身就跑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00068",
      "start_ms": 183260,
      "end_ms": 184495,
      "text": "大佛修了九十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00069",
      "start_ms": 184910,
      "end_ms": 186065,
      "text": "通高七十一米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00070",
      "start_ms": 186320,
      "end_ms": 187900,
      "text": "耳朵就有七米长脚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00071",
      "start_ms": 187900,
      "end_ms": 189745,
      "text": "背上能坐一百多个人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00072",
      "start_ms": 190650,
      "end_ms": 195365,
      "text": "更绝得是大佛身上藏着一套完整的排水系统。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00073",
      "start_ms": 196070,
      "end_ms": 197250,
      "text": "一千多年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00074",
      "start_ms": 197370,
      "end_ms": 198855,
      "text": "石头没怎么分化，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00075",
      "start_ms": 199570,
      "end_ms": 202375,
      "text": "一个人发了愿几代人接着干，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00076",
      "start_ms": 202640,
      "end_ms": 205025,
      "text": "把一座山凿成了一尊佛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00077",
      "start_ms": 205920,
      "end_ms": 206545,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00078",
      "start_ms": 206900,
      "end_ms": 210115,
      "text": "万里长城从西周开始修，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00079",
      "start_ms": 210430,
      "end_ms": 211585,
      "text": "秦始皇连起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00080",
      "start_ms": 211930,
      "end_ms": 213525,
      "text": "明朝大规模重建，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00081",
      "start_ms": 213990,
      "end_ms": 216465,
      "text": "前前后后修了两千多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00082",
      "start_ms": 217060,
      "end_ms": 219265,
      "text": "把历代修的长城加起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00083",
      "start_ms": 219580,
      "end_ms": 221755,
      "text": "总长度超过两万公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00084",
      "start_ms": 222700,
      "end_ms": 224640,
      "text": "您知道这工程量有多大吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00085",
      "start_ms": 224740,
      "end_ms": 228070,
      "text": "嘉峪关的城墙如果换算成一米厚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00086",
      "start_ms": 228370,
      "end_ms": 229455,
      "text": "五米高的墙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00087",
      "start_ms": 229800,
      "end_ms": 231100,
      "text": "能把地球绕一圈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00088",
      "start_ms": 232060,
      "end_ms": 234565,
      "text": "明朝修长城用了多少砖？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00089",
      "start_ms": 235410,
      "end_ms": 237395,
      "text": "传说当年工匠算出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00090",
      "start_ms": 238000,
      "end_ms": 243465,
      "text": "嘉峪关关城需要九十九万九千九百九十九块砖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00091",
      "start_ms": 243950,
      "end_ms": 244915,
      "text": "多一块都不要。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00092",
      "start_ms": 245830,
      "end_ms": 247135,
      "text": "结果竣工的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00093",
      "start_ms": 247450,
      "end_ms": 251735,
      "text": "偏偏多出来一块放在西瓮城的门台上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00094",
      "start_ms": 252490,
      "end_ms": 254575,
      "text": "几百年来没人敢动他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00095",
      "start_ms": 255530,
      "end_ms": 258630,
      "text": "老百姓管他叫定城砖一块砖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00096",
      "start_ms": 258670,
      "end_ms": 259755,
      "text": "放了几百年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00097",
      "start_ms": 260120,
      "end_ms": 261035,
      "text": "谁都不敢碰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00098",
      "start_ms": 261560,
      "end_ms": 263800,
      "text": "您说这规矩严到什么份上？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00099",
      "start_ms": 263860,
      "end_ms": 264465,
      "text": "第一名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00100",
      "start_ms": 264820,
      "end_ms": 266800,
      "text": "四川都江堰等等。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00101",
      "start_ms": 266980,
      "end_ms": 268675,
      "text": "都江堰不是第五名吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00102",
      "start_ms": 269550,
      "end_ms": 269925,
      "text": "对，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00103",
      "start_ms": 270370,
      "end_ms": 273015,
      "text": "第五名是都江堰水利工程。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00104",
      "start_ms": 274000,
      "end_ms": 278785,
      "text": "我说的第一名是都江堰底下的那套地下维护系统。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00105",
      "start_ms": 279360,
      "end_ms": 281520,
      "text": "您知道都江堰两千多年不坏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00106",
      "start_ms": 281520,
      "end_ms": 282625,
      "text": "靠的是什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00107",
      "start_ms": 283010,
      "end_ms": 283830,
      "text": "不是靠石头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00108",
      "start_ms": 283830,
      "end_ms": 285385,
      "text": "硬是靠制度。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00109",
      "start_ms": 286050,
      "end_ms": 288365,
      "text": "李斌当年定了六个字的规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00110",
      "start_ms": 288760,
      "end_ms": 290535,
      "text": "深陶滩低作焰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00111",
      "start_ms": 291180,
      "end_ms": 292725,
      "text": "每年冬天枯水期。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00112",
      "start_ms": 293190,
      "end_ms": 299110,
      "text": "河宫要把内江河床挖到看见埋在底下的石马为止。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00113",
      "start_ms": 299930,
      "end_ms": 304970,
      "text": "这就是深淘滩飞沙堰的高度必须比内江河床低。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00114",
      "start_ms": 305510,
      "end_ms": 309630,
      "text": "这就是低座堰李冰还在河床底下埋了卧铁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00115",
      "start_ms": 309990,
      "end_ms": 312030,
      "text": "作为青淤深度的标准，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00116",
      "start_ms": 312770,
      "end_ms": 317590,
      "text": "这套维护制度从秦朝一直执行到今天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00117",
      "start_ms": 318130,
      "end_ms": 321910,
      "text": "两千两百多年没断过别的古建筑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00118",
      "start_ms": 322030,
      "end_ms": 323740,
      "text": "靠的是材料和手艺。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00119",
      "start_ms": 324100,
      "end_ms": 327500,
      "text": "都江堰靠的是一代一代人守着规矩干活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00120",
      "start_ms": 328020,
      "end_ms": 330960,
      "text": "这才是真正坐头把交椅的东西。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00121",
      "start_ms": 331520,
      "end_ms": 332820,
      "text": "不是死的建筑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00122",
      "start_ms": 333020,
      "end_ms": 334320,
      "text": "是活的制度。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00123",
      "start_ms": 334980,
      "end_ms": 336480,
      "text": "从第五道第一名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00124",
      "start_ms": 336860,
      "end_ms": 341140,
      "text": "都江堰用两千两百年的规矩养活了上千万人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00125",
      "start_ms": 341160,
      "end_ms": 345220,
      "text": "坎儿井在地下三千多公里悄悄送水。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00126",
      "start_ms": 345800,
      "end_ms": 347840,
      "text": "乐山大佛一个人挖了眼睛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00127",
      "start_ms": 347920,
      "end_ms": 349460,
      "text": "几代人凿了九十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00128",
      "start_ms": 349760,
      "end_ms": 351380,
      "text": "长城一块定成砖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00129",
      "start_ms": 351400,
      "end_ms": 352420,
      "text": "放了几百年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00130",
      "start_ms": 352420,
      "end_ms": 353335,
      "text": "没人干度。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00131",
      "start_ms": 354040,
      "end_ms": 357165,
      "text": "都江堰底下的清淤制度一天没断过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00132",
      "start_ms": 358100,
      "end_ms": 359075,
      "text": "可您知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00133",
      "start_ms": 359860,
      "end_ms": 362570,
      "text": "这五座里面有三座，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00134",
      "start_ms": 362570,
      "end_ms": 364055,
      "text": "到今天还在干活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00135",
      "start_ms": 364900,
      "end_ms": 366740,
      "text": "还有两座藏州的秘密，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00136",
      "start_ms": 366820,
      "end_ms": 368065,
      "text": "到现在都没解开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00137",
      "start_ms": 368460,
      "end_ms": 369185,
      "text": "点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9de6118d7cf4db22_s00138",
      "start_ms": 369710,
      "end_ms": 371255,
      "text": "下一期咱们接着聊。"
    }
  ],
